Package: EffortDataTools
Type: Package
Title: Tools for Querying, Processing, and Plotting RACE Effort Data
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Sarah", "Friedman", email = "sarah.friedman@noaa.gov", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Utilities for extracting repick haul data from Oracle RACE databases, 
    merging Scientific Computing System (SCS) XML records, validating haul depth 
    and operational protocols, and visualizing haul tracks over station grid layers.
